+                # the only thread allowed to touch omni.physx.tensors buffers.
+                # TIME-based throttle, not loop-count: under contact-heavy
+                # physics the loop rate collapses, and every-Nth-iteration
+                # collapsed with it past the sidecar's 1 s staleness gate
+                # (measured 2026-08-07: snapshots went stale mid-descent).
+                _sc = _sidecar_box.get("sc")
